  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.0 corrects Predictor=2 arithmetic for multi-byte samples. Data written\n      by version 1.x with bytesPerSample greater than 1 must be read with\n      BytePredictor.DecodeLegacyBytewise and re-encoded before using the v2 decoder.",
